  "releaseNotes": "0.9.0 initial public release. Core column/Frame APIs, LINQ-like query engine, tensor-accelerated arithmetic and comparisons, lazy/eager/streaming/parallel execution strategies, CSV/JSON data sources, row filtering/slicing/sorting, join operations (inner/left/right/full outer), GroupBy with vectorized aggregates, column transformations and projections, schema-aware query planning with predicate pushdown and operation fusion, explicit null mask semantics, performance diagnostics, buffer pooling.",
